cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Baloney Detection Kit, cite this software release."
title: "Baloney Detection Kit"
abstract: >-
  Baloney Detection Kit is a framework and reference implementation for adding
  proportionate epistemic friction to AI conversations, diagnosing behavior
  across model, runtime, and conversation layers, and validating interventions
  with behavioral cross-checks, coherence analysis, scoring, and human review.
type: software
